    <string name="sign_in_certificate_changed_title">The server\'s certificate changed</string>
    <string name="sign_in_certificate_body">No certificate authority on this phone vouches for %1$s, so the app sent nothing. Trust the certificate only if its fingerprint matches the one on your server. The app will then accept this certificate, and no other, from that server.</string>
    <string name="sign_in_certificate_changed_body">%1$s presents a different certificate from the one you trusted, so the app sent nothing. If you didn\'t replace it, someone may be intercepting the connection. Trust the new certificate only if its fingerprint matches the one on your server.</string>
